{"id":"654780","name":"凉拌鸡心白","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/654780/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡心白","amount":"1个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米辣","amount":"5个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡心白切成小块。","img":"images/654780/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入烧开的清水煮2分钟。","img":"images/654780/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"胡萝卜切成丝。","img":"images/654780/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"小米辣和蒜切成碎。","img":"images/654780/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入辣椒油，盐，醋和小米辣和蒜碎调成拌料。","img":"images/654780/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡心白丝捞出和胡萝卜装在大盆里。","img":"images/654780/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入调料。","img":"images/654780/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"抓拌均匀。","img":"images/654780/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"装盘即可。","img":"images/654780/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}